        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inye Yeremia, Omukama akangambira aha kyanda ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yuda nechura, ebigo byayo nibifa, abamwo babyamire omw'itaka nibatongya, kandi Yerusalemu neboroga nerakuuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatungi nibatuma abakozi babo kutaha amaizi, kyonkai kabalikugoba aha maziba bashanga amaizi gatalimu, ebitahiso babishubyayo bili bushai. Enshoni zibaisire bashobeirwe, bebunzire aha maisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi eyomangaine kundi aha rw'enjura kubura. Abalimi nabo enshoni zibali kubi, bebunzire aha maisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyemera yanaga omwana gwayo omw'ishwa aha rw'enshonga y'obunyasi kubura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entulege zemeleire aha mabanga g'emparamata, nizishemeka nk'emishega. Zafubera amaisho aha rw'okuburwa obunyasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe bantu bange muntakire muti, ‘N'orwo tuli bafakare waitu Mukama, singa otujune aha rw'eibara lyawe. Tushubire muno enyuma, tukufakaliire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe shubi ya Isiraeli, iwe agijuna etangirwe, kiki nka washusha omunyamahanga omu nsi egi, waba nk'omugenzi alikuhiga oburaro? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshongaki kushusha omuntu ashobeirwe, kushusha omwisherukare atalikushobora kurokora muntu? Mbwenu waitu Mukama okw'osingiire omuli ichwe, kandi okwo twetwa ihanga lyawe, otatusigaho.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu eihanga eli Omukama naligambaho ati, “Abantu aba tibenda kwikara hamoi; amaguru agabo gaikara gagenzire. Aha rw'ekyo nanye Omukama nikyo ntalikubakundira! Ndaikara ninyijuka entambara zabo, mbabonabonyie nimbatura amafu gabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akangambira ati, “Abantu aba otabashabira milembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'orwo barasiiba okutaka kwabo tinkuhulire. Balikahonga myaka na bihongo bya kwokibwa, tindikwija kubikiliza. Shana ninyija kubamazaho embanda, enjara na n'endwara.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nanye mugarukamu nti, “Ganyira waitu Mukama Ruhanga, leba n'abarangi babagambiire okwo wabashubiize kutagwa aha mbanda, okutaitwa njara, n'okwo olibatunga emilembe omu nsi egi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nawe angambira ati, “Abarangi nibaranga ebishuba omw'ibara lyange. Tinkabatumaga anga kubaragira kyona kyona, anga kugira kyonabagambira. Ebyo balikubarangira nibabagambira okwo babiboine omu kubonekerwa nibababeiya. Nibabarangira ebya katozi, ebishuba byonkai ebyo balikwetondera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu inye Omukama ninkugambira okwo abarangi abalikuranga omw'ibara lyange okwo ntabatumire, bakagamba okwo omu nsi egi hatabemu ndashana na ifa, mbwenu abarangi abo bonene nibo baragwa aha mbanda, bakaitwa n'enjara bakahwaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'abantu abo balikurangira ebishuba barahwa omu mbarabara za Yerusalemu, baitwe eifa n'embanda. Kandi taliho arabaziika: Bonene, bakazi babo n'abaana babo. Ninyija kubabonabonyia mbature amafu gabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akangambira ati, “Obagambiire oti, ‘Kanfukumuke amalira nyemishana n'ekiro gatalikwoma, kuba abantu b'eihanga lyange bateirwe kubi bahutara muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandikushohora aheru mbona abagwire omu ndashana. Kutaha omu kigo nshangamu abarambaziibwe enjara. Abarangi n'abakuhani omu nsi balimu mara emilimo yabo nibagikora, nawe ekyo balikukora tibalikukimanya.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waitu Mukama, Yuda ogihiiremu kimoi emikono? Sioni wagitamirwa kimoi? Otuteleireki otyo muno tutashobora kutambirwa? Tukategeleza okubona emilembe, titwagiboine. Twashubira kutambirwa, kandi ebiyengo byonkai byaba nibyo bitugwera! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waitu Mukama, nitumanya okwo tuli babi, aha rw'okuba tukufakaliire, nangu na batataichwe bakakufakalira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Osingire, twakutaho amani gawe otatutamirwa kimoi. Leka kushonaza Yerusalemu enketo yawe ey'ekitinwa. Singa oijuke endagano eyo waragaine naichwe, oleke kugiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuli baruhanga abanyamahanga, halimu ruhanga ayakugwisa enjura? Isi eiguru lyonene lyonkai lyakugwa enjura? Manya waitu iwe, Mukama Ruhanga waitu, n'iwe ogwisa enjura egyo! Ichwe eshubi yaitu eli omuli iwe, kuba byona ebi n'iwe obikora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
